{"id":42897,"mal_id":42897,"title":"Horimiya","englishTitle":"Horimiya","title_english":"Horimiya","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Hori-san and Miyamura-kun"],"en":"Horimiya","ja":"ホリミヤ"},"synopsis":"On the surface, the thought of Kyouko Hori and Izumi Miyamura getting along would be the last thing in people's minds. After all, Hori has a perfect combination of beauty and brains, while Miyamura appears meek and distant to his fellow classmates. However, a fateful meeting between the two lays both of their hidden selves bare. Even though she is popular at school, Hori has little time to socialize with her friends due to housework. On the other hand, Miyamura lives under the noses of his peers, his body bearing secret tattoos and piercings that make him look like a gentle delinquent.\n\nHaving opposite personalities yet sharing odd similarities, the two quickly become friends and often spend time together in Hori's home. As they both emerge from their shells, they share with each other a side of themselves concealed from the outside world.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"En la superficie, la idea de que Kyouko Hori e Izumi Miyamura se llevaran bien sería lo último que pasaría por la mente de la gente. Después de todo, Hori tiene una combinación perfecta de belleza e inteligencia, mientras que Miyamura parece manso y distante ante sus compañeros de clase. Sin embargo, un fatídico encuentro entre los dos deja al descubierto su yo oculto. Aunque es popular en la escuela, Hori tiene poco tiempo para socializar con sus amigos debido a las tareas del hogar. Por otro lado, Miyamura vive bajo las narices de sus compañeros, su cuerpo lleva tatuajes secretos y piercings que lo hacen parecer un delincuente amable.\n\nAl tener personalidades opuestas pero compartir extrañas similitudes, los dos rápidamente se hacen amigos y a menudo pasan tiempo juntos en la casa de Hori. Cuando ambos emergen de sus caparazones, comparten un lado de sí mismos oculto al mundo exterior.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1432,"average_episode_duration":1432,"startDate":"2021-01-10","start_date":"2021-01-10","endDate":"2021-04-04","end_date":"2021-04-04","season":"winter","year":2021,"start_season":{"year":2021,"season":"winter"},"episodes":13,"num_episodes":13,"score":8.18,"mean":8.18,"numListUsers":1701586,"num_list_users":1701586,"genres":[{"id":22,"name":"Romance"},{"id":23,"name":"School"},{"id":27,"name":"Shounen"}],"studios":[{"id":1835,"name":"CloverWorks"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1695/111486.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1695/111486l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1695/111486.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1695/111486l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1695/111486l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"sunday","time":"00:30","day_of_the_week":"sunday","start_time":"00:30","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"sunday 00:30"},"rank":489,"popularity":75,"rating":"pg_13","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":1035868,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2020-09-16T10:56:10+00:00","updated_at":"2023-03-25T05:26:28+00:00","source":"manga","background":null,"related_anime":[{"node":{"id":14753,"title":"Hori-san to Miyamura-kun","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/2/40175.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/2/40175l.jpg"}},"relation_type":"alternative_version","relation_type_formatted":"Alternative version"},{"node":{"id":54856,"title":"Horimiya: Piece","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1007/136277.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1007/136